<title>USA: Garden Botanika Oct same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>Garden Botanika Oct same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>REDMOND, Wash. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Garden Botanika Inc said its same-store sales in the four-week period ended November 2 were up two percent.</p>
<p>Total sales rose 70 percent to $5.7 million from $3.3 million last October, when the company operated 78 fewer stores.</p>
<p>It also said catalog sales increased 51 percent in October from a year earlier, mainly due to increased circulation.</p>
